{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56637","headline":"继古韵一百十二字赠穆先生 · 无名氏","name":"继古韵一百十二字赠穆先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大华山阴穆老仙。\n专持清静探幽玄。\n修补只陀无漏园，常流慧水溉心田。\n擒猿缚马翠峯巅，定观不用买山钱。\n舍俗投玄心契悟，善恶之由夙世缘。\n心香福炷起灵源，杳杳冥冥达上天。\n秋日碧潭真了了，野花啼鸟谩喧喧。\n鼎中火灭开金蘂，木上无烟结玉莲，垒功积行满三千，性圆丹结去朝元。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第四一八页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}